STEP 6 - VERIFY CONTAINERS
--------------------------

docker ps

Expected:

postgres   Up
langfuse   Up


STEP 7 - VERIFY LOGS
--------------------

docker logs langfuse

Expected:

Server started

No DATABASE_URL errors.


STEP 8 - ACCESS LANGFUSE UI
---------------------------

Open Browser:

http://localhost:3000

OR

http://<ubuntu-ip>:3000

Get IP:

hostname -I


USEFUL COMMANDS
---------------

